{"chars": "Then, one day in the middle of March, something wonderful happened at the North Pole. A thin line of gold appeared at the edge of the sky, then a sliver of orange, and then, for the first time in six whole months, the sun peeked up over the edge of the world. The elves ran out into the snow, cheering and waving their caps, jingle, jingle, jingle. Every day after that, the sun climbed a little higher, until it didn't set at all, and the North Pole glowed all day and all night long.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.4, 0.45, 0.45, 0.45, 0.45, 0.675, 0.675, 0.675, 0.675, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 0.988, 0.988, 0.988, 0.988, 1.075, 1.075, 1.075, 1.075, 1.075, 1.075, 1.075, 1.337, 1.337, 1.337, 1.45, 1.45, 1.45, 1.45, 1.45, 1.45, 1.975, 2.075, 2.075, 2.075, 2.075, 2.075, 2.075, 2.075, 2.075, 2.075, 2.075, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 3.312, 3.312, 3.312, 3.388, 3.388, 3.388, 3.388, 3.475, 3.475, 3.475, 3.475, 3.475, 3.475, 3.75, 3.75, 3.75, 3.75, 3.75, 4.55, 4.662, 4.662, 4.787, 4.787, 4.787, 4.787, 4.787, 5.025, 5.025, 5.025, 5.025, 5.025, 5.237, 5.237, 5.237, 5.35, 5.35, 5.35, 5.35, 5.35, 5.7, 5.7, 5.7, 5.7, 5.7, 5.7, 5.7, 5.7, 5.7, 6.062, 6.062, 6.062, 6.138, 6.138, 6.138, 6.138, 6.275, 6.275, 6.275, 6.275, 6.275, 6.513, 6.513, 6.513, 6.588, 6.588, 6.588, 6.588, 6.713, 6.713, 6.713, 6.713, 7.325, 7.45, 7.45, 7.45, 7.45, 7.45, 7.588, 7.588, 7.688, 7.688, 7.688, 7.688, 7.688, 7.688, 7.688, 8.025, 8.025, 8.025, 8.188, 8.188, 8.188, 8.188, 8.188, 8.188, 8.188, 8.9, 9.0, 9.0, 9.0, 9.0, 9.113, 9.113, 9.113, 9.113, 9.113, 9.4, 9.475, 9.475, 9.475, 9.475, 9.588, 9.588, 9.588, 9.588, 9.688, 9.688, 9.688, 9.688, 9.688, 9.688, 9.975, 9.975, 9.975, 9.975, 9.975, 10.213, 10.213, 10.213, 10.363, 10.363, 10.363, 10.363, 10.6, 10.6, 10.6, 10.6, 10.6, 10.6, 10.825, 10.825, 10.825, 10.825, 10.825, 10.825, 10.825, 11.35, 11.45, 11.45, 11.45, 11.45, 11.588, 11.588, 11.588, 11.588, 11.875, 11